playwright-report/
test-results/
infra/nginx/certs/

# Data-safety (CLAUDE.md hard rule 1): files derived from MIMIC, or of unknown
# provenance, never enter an image. Serving needs none of them (checked:
# nothing on the inference import path reads them).
